{"unit_id":"CAOGGL__dsh-ding#card-zh","repo":"CAOGGL/dsh-ding","commit":"bff6c902a52af17856afbe689a218aa3a8f8f4cf","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ding 是面向 DSH Web 和桌面客户端的通知插件：宿主监听 Agent 回合状态，在整轮对话真正结束时播放提示音并显示 Windows 通知，也可在长任务运行、Agent 提问或工具审批等待时提醒。通知可按当前查看会话静默，点击通知可跳转到对应会话。Web 对话页提供铃铛设置面板，可切换声音和通知、调节音量、选择或上传音效，并导入导出设置。适合希望离开窗口时仍能留意 DSH 回复的用户；需要 Windows 通知与 PowerShell，配置可通过 bundle 默认值或 Web 面板调整。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:222","lib/index.js:952","lib/index.js:1001","lib/index.js:1030","lib/client.js:1173","cordis.patch.yml:4"]}
{"unit_id":"CAOGGL__dsh-ding#card-en","repo":"CAOGGL/dsh-ding","commit":"bff6c902a52af17856afbe689a218aa3a8f8f4cf","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-ding alerts DSH web and desktop users when an agent turn ends with a sound and Windows notification. It also reminds about long tasks, questions, and approvals. Users can quiet the session in view, open a conversation from an alert, and manage sounds and settings in the web bell panel.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:222","lib/index.js:952","lib/index.js:1001","lib/index.js:1030","lib/client.js:1173","cordis.patch.yml:4"]}
