{"unit_id":"CAOGGL__dsh-ding#feature-1","repo":"CAOGGL/dsh-ding","commit":"bff6c902a52af17856afbe689a218aa3a8f8f4cf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ding 的功能「整轮完成提醒」：当最新对话回合真正结束时，插件播放提示音并显示 Windows 通知；它会过滤中途 idle 和子代理事件，并使用防抖和最小间隔控制提醒。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:925","lib/index.js:952"]}
{"unit_id":"CAOGGL__dsh-ding#feature-2","repo":"CAOGGL/dsh-ding","commit":"bff6c902a52af17856afbe689a218aa3a8f8f4cf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ding 的功能「长任务运行提醒」：Agent 持续运行超过配置的首次延迟后，插件定期显示运行中通知，并在任务结束或 Agent 释放时清理计时器。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:952","cordis.patch.yml:14"]}
{"unit_id":"CAOGGL__dsh-ding#feature-3","repo":"CAOGGL/dsh-ding","commit":"bff6c902a52af17856afbe689a218aa3a8f8f4cf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ding 的功能「问题等待提醒」：Agent 调用 ask_user_question 等待用户回答时，插件会立即发出提问通知，并带上首个问题文本。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1001"]}
{"unit_id":"CAOGGL__dsh-ding#feature-4","repo":"CAOGGL/dsh-ding","commit":"bff6c902a52af17856afbe689a218aa3a8f8f4cf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ding 的功能「工具审批提醒」：工具审批请求到达时，插件可发出审批通知；通知可引导用户回到发起请求的会话处理审批。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1030"]}
{"unit_id":"CAOGGL__dsh-ding#feature-5","repo":"CAOGGL/dsh-ding","commit":"bff6c902a52af17856afbe689a218aa3a8f8f4cf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ding 的功能「铃铛设置面板」：Web 对话页顶栏注入铃铛控件，用户可切换提示音、调音量、管理通知选项并选择或上传音效。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1173","lib/index.js:737"]}
{"unit_id":"CAOGGL__dsh-ding#feature-6","repo":"CAOGGL/dsh-ding","commit":"bff6c902a52af17856afbe689a218aa3a8f8f4cf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ding 的功能「通知点击跳转」：通知携带会话目标；在 Web 中可定位对应会话，桌面客户端通过事件流在应用内切换到目标会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:744","lib/client.js:1158"]}
